tde-systemd (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Systemd Manager with overview, services, timers, date & time,
      hostname and locale pages for the system and user managers.
    - Journal Viewer with filters, follow mode, export and maintenance.
    - TDE Control Center modules.
    - polkit authorized helper for system changes.
    - Handbook and manual pages.

